# Bifur, Melodic Rider: "As long as you have an enduring story, if a triggered ability of a Dwarf you control triggers, that
# ability triggers an additional time" (CR 603.2d). Five Moxes give Bot1 the story as Bifur enters on turn one. On turn
# three Fíli enters, a Dwarf: its "Whenever Fíli ... enters" triggers twice, so Bot1 gets two Dwarf tokens (one without
# Bifur). The tokens entering trigger nothing - Fíli's ability is for nontoken Dwarves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Bifur, Melodic Rider
Fíli the Pathfinder
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Bifur, Melodic Rider.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.EnduringStory = true
Bot1.Hand.Fíli the Pathfinder.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl; Mox Jet; Mox Emerald; Mox Sapphire; Bifur, Melodic Rider; Fíli the Pathfinder; Dwarf Token; Dwarf Token
Bot1.Battlefield.Dwarf Token#1.Power = 3
